      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE '9300-CUSTFILE-CLOSE error path RC 99 abends'
            MOCK CALL 'CBSTM03B' USING WS-M03B-AREA
                MOVE '99' TO WS-M03B-RC
            END-MOCK
