      ******************************************************************
      *  TC14 -- 9100-TRNXFILE-CLOSE alternate success path (RC '04')    
      *  Exercises the OR-RHS of the IF on line 862:                     
      *      IF WS-M03B-RC = '00' OR '04' CONTINUE                       
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE '9100-TRNXFILE-CLOSE alternate RC 04 path'
            MOCK CALL 'CBSTM03B' USING WS-M03B-AREA
                MOVE '04' TO WS-M03B-RC
            END-MOCK
